            <ArticleTitle>[Laparoscopic sleeve gastric resection: experience of Bariatric Department in University of Cyprus, Greece].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>14-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Experience of laparoscopic sleeve gastric resection performance for morbid obesity was summarized. Indications for the method application, the operation procedure details, its mechanism of action, securing the body mass reduction, are adduced. The efficacy and security of the intervention were estimated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
